    "Additional options such as front LED and Linde BlueSpot™ maximize safety in the warehouse"
   ]
  },
  {
   "group": "Ergonomics",
   "bullets": [
    "Wide operator’s platform, easily accessible from both sides, with low access for easy boarding and alighting",
    "Order picking of two pallets at a height that is easy on the back saves unnecessary movements",
    "Individual design of the driver’s cab with many storage areas",
    "Intuitively operable Linde Steering Wheel with meaningful symbols indicating key functions",
    "Fully suspended operator’s compartment reduces vibrations and shocks"
   ]
  },
  {
   "group": "Handling",
   "bullets": [
