      "Self-centering electric steering speeds up operation",
      "Automatic braking when operator steps off the platform or presses the emergency isolator",
      "Additional options such as front LED and Linde BlueSpot maximise safety in the warehouse"
     ]
    },
    {
     "group": "Ergonomics",
     "bullets": [
